[I] Database drivers for the libdbi abstraction layer

[T] libdbi-drivers supplies the database drivers the libdbi framework uses
[T] to talk to the supported database servers, such as SQLite 3, PostgreSQL
[T] and MySQL. GnuCash uses them for its SQL backends.

[U] https://libdbi-drivers.sourceforge.net/

[A] Markus Hoenicka
[M] The T2 Project <t2@t2-project.org>

[C] extra/database
[F] CROSS

[L] LGPL
[V] 0.9.0
[P] X -----5---9 200.100

[D] 00b4efb7150f9196965e4037d685facf35dd44dc146bda283fe57581 libdbi-drivers-0.9.0.tar.gz https://downloads.sourceforge.net/project/libdbi-drivers/libdbi-drivers/libdbi-drivers-0.9.0/

var_append confopt ' ' "--disable-docs --with-dbi-incdir=$root$includedir --with-dbi-libdir=$root$libdir"
pkginstalled sqlite && var_append confopt ' ' --with-sqlite3
pkginstalled postgresql && var_append confopt ' ' "--with-pgsql --with-pgsql-incdir=$root$(pkgprefix includedir postgresql) --with-pgsql-libdir=$root$(pkgprefix libdir postgresql)"
pkginstalled mariadb && var_append confopt ' ' --with-mysql
